 "open_questions": [
  "The maker recommends a constant-current backlight driver (\"It is recommended to use IC (AW9364)\", zjy128 p7); this follows Waveshare's module: 3.3 V through 10 Ω and a transistor (backlight 40 mA typ, VLED 2.9-3.1 V).",
  "VDD is 3.3 V, the panel's maximum (2.8 V typical), as on Waveshare's module.",
  "Solder pads drawn from the flex's contacts (0.35 x 2.0, the 2.0 read uncertainly off the drawing); the alignment holes' position along the flex is estimated.",
